<title>USA: Roxbury CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</title>
<headline>Roxbury CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross Inc. said it won $2.700 million of Roxbury CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, Series B, with a net interest cost of 5.35 percent.</p>
</text>
